[
  {
    "id": "angel_1",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Daylight softly filters into my room through the windowpane.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_2"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_2",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Each day looks like the one before, as if time had begun to loop, condemned to endlessly repeat the same motions.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_3"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_3",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "What's the point of getting up one more time?",
    "glitch": true,
    "typeSpeed": 18,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_4"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_4",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "The question drifts through my mind as I lie still for a few moments, my eyes fixed on the ceiling.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_5"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_5",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Eventually, I force myself out of bed.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_6"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_6",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/room.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "My body, however, seems to want to stay there. Every movement feels heavy, almost mechanical. I set my feet on the floor, stand up slowly, then cross my room toward the bathroom.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/room.mp3",
    "next": "angel_7"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_7",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Once in front of the mirror, I stop.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_8"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_8",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I raise my eyes to my reflection.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_9"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_9",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "But what I see there is only a pale version of myself.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_10"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_10",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Hmm… it's the mirror that seems to be cracked.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_11"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_11",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I slowly reach out, trying to touch one of the cracks.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_12"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_12",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Ouch!",
    "glitch": true,
    "typeSpeed": 30,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "bloodEffect": "light",
    "next": "angel_13"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_13",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "The moment my fingers brush the glass, a sharp piece breaks off and slices my palm.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_14"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_14",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "A sharp pain shoots through me. It instantly jolts my senses awake.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_15"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_15",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Yet I'm in no real hurry to stop the bleeding. I simply watch the blood slide down my hand, passively.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_16"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_16",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Then I glance at the time.",
    "typeSpeed": 18,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_17"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_17",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Damn… I'm already late for class.",
    "glitch": true,
    "typeSpeed": 18,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "angel_18"
  },
  {
    "id": "angel_18",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/bathroom.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I quickly grab my bag and rush toward the exit door.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/dark.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "corridor_1",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "The school corridor is already completely deserted.",
    "typeSpeed": 22,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_2"
  },
  {
    "id": "corridor_2",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I'm definitely late…",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_3"
  },
  {
    "id": "corridor_3",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "My footsteps echo through the silence as I head toward my locker. That's when I notice a small piece of paper sticking out from the edge.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_4"
  },
   {
    "id": "corridor_4",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "Another one of those poems.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_5"
  },
    {
    "id": "corridor_5",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "You'd think the stranger who writes them has gotten into the habit of leaving me one every time.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "corridor_6"
  },
  {
    "id": "corridor_6",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "text": "I unfold the paper slowly.",
    "typeSpeed": 20,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "next": "poem_1"
  },
  {
    "id": "poem_1",
    "type": "poem",
    "bg": "images/backgrounds/schoolcorridor.webp",
    "charImg": null,
    "speaker": null,
    "music": "music/reflexion.mp3",
    "poem": [
      "I adore thee as much as the nocturnal vault,",
      "O vessel of sorrow, O tall, silent one,",
      "And I love you the more, beautiful one, because you flee from me,",
      "And because you seem, ornament of my nights,",
      "Ironical, to multiply the distance",
      "Which separates my arms from the blue immensities.",
      "I advance to the attack, I climb to the assault,",
      "Like a choir of worms after a corpse,",
      "And I cherish, O implacable and cruel beast!",
      "Even that coldness which makes you more beautiful to me."
    ],
    "author": "Charles Baudelaire",
    "next": "__suite_suivante__"
  }
]